<section id="services" class="py-28 max-md:py-18">
  <h2
    class="max-w-[14ch] min-w-0 m-0 wrap-anywhere font-editorial text-section text-site-ink"
  >
    Website services
  </h2>
  <div class="mt-18 border-t border-site-rule max-md:mt-12">
    <div
      class="grid gap-6 border-b border-site-rule py-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] md:gap-16 lg:gap-20"
    >
      <h3 class="min-w-0 m-0 wrap-anywhere text-xl font-[660] text-site-ink">
        Builds, rebuilds, and migrations
      </h3>
      <div class="max-w-[37rem] text-body leading-[1.65] text-site-muted [&_p]:m-0 [&_p+p]:mt-6">
        <p>
          We agree the scope of your website project before work begins, whether
          you need a new site, a rebuild, or a move to another platform.
        </p>
        <p>
          After delivery, your company can take over managing the website, or you
          can choose continued help from me. We agree what the handover needs;
          ongoing support is optional.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid gap-6 border-b border-site-rule py-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] md:gap-16 lg:gap-20"
    >
      <h3 class="min-w-0 m-0 wrap-anywhere text-xl font-[660] text-site-ink">
        Optional maintenance and improvements
      </h3>
      <p class="max-w-[37rem] m-0 text-body leading-[1.65] text-site-muted">
        If you want continued help, we can agree a monthly maintenance
        arrangement. We can also plan improvements as your needs change,
        agreeing the scope before work begins.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid gap-6 border-b border-site-rule py-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] md:gap-16 lg:gap-20"
    >
      <h3 class="min-w-0 m-0 wrap-anywhere text-xl font-[660] text-site-ink">
        Optional monitoring and response
      </h3>
      <div class="max-w-[37rem] text-body leading-[1.65] text-site-muted [&_p]:m-0 [&_p+p]:mt-6">
        <p>
          Monitoring can help spot agreed types of website problems. Responding
          to them is a separate choice. We can discuss on-call coverage or faster
          response, with scope, availability, and response expectations agreed
          for your engagement.
        </p>
        <p>
          Response time is how soon you hear back, not how soon a problem is fixed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
